{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07704","headline":"彭蠡湖中望庐山 · 孟浩然","name":"彭蠡湖中望庐山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太虚生月晕，舟子知天风。\n挂席候明发，眇漫平湖中。\n中流见匡阜，势压九江雄。\n黤黕容霁色，峥嵘当晓空。\n香炉初上日，瀑布喷成虹。\n久欲追尚子，况兹怀远公。\n我来限于役，未暇息微躬。\n淮海途将半，星霜岁欲穷。\n寄言岩栖者，毕趣当来同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07704.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07704","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}